 `applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
 without changing the supplied document. It supports the `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and
-`test` operations and throws when the patch is invalid or an operation fails.
+`test` operations and throws when the patch is invalid or an operation fails. Both the patch and its
+operations must be JSON-compatible values; evaluation stops at the first error and never changes the
+supplied document.
 
 ```ts
 import { applyPatch } from "json-toolkit";
